 /*
- * Base styles for the Field Notes blog.
- * Deliberately plain. Every color, font, radius and spacing value is a custom
- * property in :root so the whole look can be replaced from one place.
+ * Field Notes blog, styled with Margin Notes (design-system/VERSION).
+ * Every value comes from design-system/tokens.css; do not hard-code colors,
+ * sizes, radii or shadows here. Breakpoints: md = 860px, lg = 1200px.
  */
